    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493730/extras/a81956286903dd8879542557aeb30099.avif?t=1752052105\" width=800 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER COUCH CO-OP ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your spear! Pierce your enemies! Go on expeditions with up to 6 player marshmallows to rekindle your sacred campfire in this hunters\u2019 ritual</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SANDBOX OVERWORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated map for every run, clear your own path to retrieve the sacred flames. expanding your influence on the map unlocks more events, levels and dungeons to choose next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SIMPLE CONTROLS, HECTIC GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use spears to pierce and push your way to glory, weave through the flames and traps while using them to your advantage, clearing obstacles and foes together amid the mayhem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNTERS LEGACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and change your appearance throughout your journey, one-up your friends through impressive combat feats and cement your legacy in stone at the end of each expedition, unlocking more enemies, tools and locations for the hunters that come after</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493730/extras/b31869584554c0cac5735dcce0616e55.avif?t=1752052105\" width=800 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Joystick : movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Joystick : shoot (aim/release)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Trigger \uff1ashoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Square Button : use tool</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >option/menu\uff1aremove controller</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493730/extras/a81956286903dd8879542557aeb30099.avif?t=1752052105\" width=800 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER COUCH CO-OP ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your spear! Pierce your enemies! Go on expeditions with up to 6 player marshmallows to rekindle your sacred campfire in this hunters\u2019 ritual</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SANDBOX OVERWORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated map for every run, clear your own path to retrieve the sacred flames. expanding your influence on the map unlocks more events, levels and dungeons to choose next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SIMPLE CONTROLS, HECTIC GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use spears to pierce and push your way to glory, weave through the flames and traps while using them to your advantage, clearing obstacles and foes together amid the mayhem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNTERS LEGACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and change your appearance throughout your journey, one-up your friends through impressive combat feats and cement your legacy in stone at the end of each expedition, unlocking more enemies, tools and locations for the hunters that come after</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493730/extras/b31869584554c0cac5735dcce0616e55.avif?t=1752052105\" width=800 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Joystick : movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Joystick : shoot (aim/release)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Trigger \uff1ashoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Square Button : use tool</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >option/menu\uff1aremove controller</p>",
    "short_description": "Hot Stuff is a casual action oriented party game, with procedural elements and simple controls, suitable for different types of players to quickly pick up and play together, achieving cooperation within the chaos.",
